@rekram1-node The issue is still in place, and it blocks agent selection in the ACP connection of opencode with other agents like Maestro or OpenCLAW. I just can not pick the agent from the plugin. Also, this makes the global `--pure` redundant. 

If you don't mind, I can take a look at this one for the proper solution. 

Asking before writing any code to avoid a waste of your or my time

Thank you for the response Problem was solved once I've set 


  "provider": {
    "minimax": {
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000,
          "chunkTimeout": 120000
        },

which maybe is a regression because I understand that once I've set "chunkTimeout": 120000 requests get retry after 2 min without response from server ?

This error was occurring for me on some high-stress workflow, many agents in parallel running requests to the same provider (MiniMax)
